Comment: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a warm place that keeps me out of the wind and rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was even given a soft and fluffy mattress...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And there's konpeito in my bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My life feels complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Complete my ass. You only have like one or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, it'll take you a\Nhundred years to fill that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it takes me a hundred years, I'll still do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you telling me to follow you around for a hundred years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know what you're supposed to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to heal wounded hearts to collect more and more konpeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The birds are singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers are shining in their morning dew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They smell great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can discover so much if you just wake up earlier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're taking a walk as an\Nexcuse to slack off, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lovely road there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why were you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's because these green leaves are beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The green leaves being\Nbeautiful makes people cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, may I ask for your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you shouldn't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku as in Kohaku from heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No wonder I felt a different presence around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And who might he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.04,0:04:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to be secretive in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi... I think I've heard that name somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you do! It's not Ioryogi, but something similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Are you {\i1}that{\i0} Iorogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.53,0:05:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're actually a cute little thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, I go by Ioryogi here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Ioryogi it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.55,0:05:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to water the trees in the garden before the sunlight gets stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That scared me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was looking at the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how hard I look at them, tears won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when I look at them, I turn into a fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause the person who comes to help out is a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me want to cry when I look at this mess and know it'll take me until sunset to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just watch me clean it up in the blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know why Kohaku was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll heal her heart if she's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As if you'd learn anything from reading those magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I might get a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still don't understand why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll wake up early and ask her again tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you had a good day at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you wanna be a third wheel or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Third wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you barge in now, you'll just get in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't have to come all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could've just waited at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But walking home with you makes me feel so happy, Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I want to spend as much time as possible with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're flirting like no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a splendid mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never live in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well! Your heart can get wounded even if you're rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I learned it from the magazines at the convenience store!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.47,0:08:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When should I go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.09,0:09:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're getting the wrong idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for not being able to keep my promise today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, you were up all night...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the patients are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're important too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, I told you that you have no business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O, Faeries of the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Answer my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lend me your powers to enrich the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather in order to help these lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O, Rain of blessing, fall upon the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, how beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'M SOAKING WET NOW!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be the one apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for barging in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A little while ago, I saw you with a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for trailing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I still don't understand why you were crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But whenever I see beautiful things,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think to myself, "I wish Shuichiro could be here to see it too".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then I start thinking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever I think about Shuichiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I get a tight feeling in my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tight feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I start feeling sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The satisfied feeling I get whenever I'm with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the times when I see him smile shyly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All these memories fill up my heart and I can't help but think about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then I start crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still don't get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I can't really explain it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, you've fallen in love but it's painful and you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so it's love...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, it's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit pretending you understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've read that love always comes with distress!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, is there anything bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's more because\NShuichiro is always really busy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and we've never had the time to go on a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Date?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like going to the amusement\Npark with the person you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A date at the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me, Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku's heart will be healed if she goes on a date with Shuichiro at the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, I must investigate this so-called amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The tickets cost 3000 yen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it costs money to go to the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't have any...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, healing Kohaku is kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First prize, a trip to Hawaii!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Second prize, a trip to a hot spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Third prize, amusement park tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After you spin this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the color of the bead that comes out determines your prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The prizes all come in pairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come try your luck at the lucky draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like they're giving out\Namusement park tickets as prizes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady, where's your lucky draw ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without one, you won't be able to participate in the draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need another ticket in order to get the amusement park tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky draw ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's pointless to be so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Kohaku is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky draw tickets are rather hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! You aren't depressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, as if you'd ever\Nfind one dropped on the--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a lucky draw ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me spin it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G-Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amusement park tickets...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations! You won a prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.01,0:15:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifth prize, an alligator doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take good care of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't get more useless than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you even take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The person who gave it to me was so nice...\NIt would've been extremely rude not to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anything besides amusement park tickets is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit daydreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You deliver newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I heard from Miss Sayaka that you work at a pizzeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.67,0:16:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, so hardworking...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An alligator I got from a lucky draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.57,0:16:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amusement park tickets...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got them from my workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you give these to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll trade you my alligator!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku needs to go on a date at the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you can go on a date with Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with those newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm helping someone deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You agreed to deliver newspapers in order to get these tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think Shuichiro will have the time anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it'd be a waste to just throw them away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you go yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, with Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Ioryogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These tickets are pointless if you and Shuichiro don't go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that's impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I can't be so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...considered selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From what I saw, Shuichiro was also really happy when he's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're as important to him as he is to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he also wants to go on a date with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have those tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.91,0:19:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro, you'll go with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't particularly dislike the ferris wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you can't, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They must be really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a messenger from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he also someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Time limit, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So the bottle has to be filled by four changes of seasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, there's a time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's four changes of seasons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means we have a year to fill the bottle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.59,0:21:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it isn't filled by then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to go to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And take a look at the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because Kohaku's heart wasn't healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to heal those who are already filled with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that means she wasn't hurt or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should you really be happy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You get 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,100?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.31,0:22:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Negative... 100?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A failure in choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.25,0:22:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Giving you a negative 100 is going easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm happy that she's happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't act so carefree! You only have one year!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should start panicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.90,0:22:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you to start panicking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of look do you get when you panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.63,0:22:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're getting the wrong idea again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:15.20,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord2\b1\fs22\c&H4F49D5&\pos(70,162)\3c&HC8EBE8&}Delicious Food\Nfor Thought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:49.86,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:57.53,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:52.71,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:57.30,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:01.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:04.11,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:11.45,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:17.03,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.87,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:27.47,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:30.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:35.46,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:38.27,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:41.86,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:44.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:47.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:54.24,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:58.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:02.90,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
